to Ukraine…","url":"https://x.com/Firebird063/status/2110341752242745565"},{"author_id":"4832692257","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:06:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110341571162022363"],"id":"2110341571162022363","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110333196621492513","type":"retweeted"}],"text":"RT @jgmac1106: SpaceX can not introduce speed restrictions on Starshield without Pentagon approval\n\nSpaceX and Starlink do not have Operati…","url":"https://x.com/GuidoChiabrera/status/2110341571162022363"},{"author_id":"115150146","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:06:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110341566569078972"],"id":"2110341566569078972","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":214},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110278144259178523","type":"retweeted"}],"text":"RT @saintjavelin: SpaceX reportedly imposed a 100 mph speed limit on Starlink terminals using Starshield overnight, without warning Ukraini…","url":"https://x.com/balorian/status/2110341566569078972"},{"author_id":"2091392166526582784","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:06:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110341499213021339"],"id":"2110341499213021339","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":122},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110327426580648014","type":"retweeted"}],"text":"RT @cb_doge: There is a lot of misinformation being spread about Starlink.\n\nStarlink provides internet to homes and businesses. Starshield…","url":"https://x.com/Inidiapaper/status/2110341499213021339"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110327417831358464"]},"author_id":"1389913567671975937","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:10:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110327426580648014"],"id":"2110327426580648014","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":22190,"like_count":487,"quote_count":23,"reply_count":80,"retweet_count":122},"text":"There is a lot of misinformation being spread about Starlink.\n\nStarlink provides internet to homes and businesses. Starshield serves government and military users, including systems under US government control.\n\nThey are different services. Stop confusing Starlink and Starshield. https://t.co/4CjPA2d34h"},{"author_id":"1693021331665584129","created_at":"2026-10-14T08:44:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110290753742414293"],"id":"2110290753742414293","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":2216,"like_count":82,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110276531948011620","type":"quoted"}],"text":"While this is incredibly stupid, nitpickingly this isn’t necessarily SpaceX but the US government operated starshield https://t.co/GgNJKgcnKO"},{"author_id":"238447187","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:18:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110329334129205630"],"id":"2110329334129205630","in_reply_to_user_id":"1835559593541505024","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110327904584557032","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@drcjjackson He doesn't. It's not Starlink but Starshield. That's the military version the US government pays for and controls."},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110296944585125888"]},"author_id":"1388819128052506627","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:09:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110296948993348009"],"id":"2110296948993348009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3069,"like_count":57,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":31},"text":"Reports continue to come in from the front that Starshield (military version of Elon Musk's Starlink) no longer functions for drone operations.\n\nThis refers to functionality inside Ukraine. https://t.co/zwAuQWceFR"},{"author_id":"27620289","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:11:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110327740419232088"],"id":"2110327740419232088","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":712,"like_count":55,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110305562596426009","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Starshield is the version sold to militaries.\n\nIt is directly controlled by the US Military.\n\nStarlink can not cut it off\n\nThis would have come from the Pentagon https://t.co/E52B0VGGz4"},{"author_id":"114974793","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:38:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110334345378398697"],"id":"2110334345378398697","in_reply_to_user_id":"3108351","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110313050423095339","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@WSJ Starshield is run by the government"},{"author_id":"1898374177171632128","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:02:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110340484266598498"],"id":"2110340484266598498","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":33,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110276978523644195","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Ukraine uses Starshield, a US government satellite network built and maintained by SpaceX. It was bought and paid for by the American taxpayer. The same taxpayers Zelensky is attacking by bombing Russian refineries. https://t.co/nOf5JDXsin"},{"author_id":"5378612","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:28:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110301677131645262"],"id":"2110301677131645262","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":425,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110240563135951022","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Excuse me, Mr. @elonmusk . Ukrainian military officials have confirmed that SpaceX restricted Starshield services without prior warning, disrupting critical military operations.\n\nDid you personally authorize these restrictions? Were they requested by the Trump administration?\n\nIf https://t.co/NcuNJfreT6"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110273783537766400","3_2110273802223439872"]},"author_id":"1550895583476449280","created_at":"2026-10-14T07:37:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110273816220012834"],"id":"2110273816220012834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":4673,"like_count":402,"quote_count":21,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":185},"text":"🚨 SpaceX has unexpectedly imposed a 100 mph speed limit on StarShield military terminals while in motion, Ukrainian officials confirmed.\n\nImplemented overnight without advance warning, the restriction directly disrupted active defense missions. https://t.co/kpHOn7gyGj"},{"author_id":"1809524786730790912","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:43:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110305562596426009"],"id":"2110305562596426009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":12956,"like_count":764,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":95},"text":"If it’s true that @SpaceX is limiting military grade (starshield) terminals in Ukraine, if I was an investor I’d be angry. As it is an action that will ultimately push countries who are wanting it for military and security away from signing a contract. It’s also likely to have"},{"author_id":"27620289","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:59:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110324666753531953"],"id":"2110324666753531953","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":964,"like_count":122,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":32},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110265651524972996","type":"quoted"}],"text":"It's worse than Starlink, SpaceX cut off Starshield, the military version sold to Governments.\n\nThis means the White House and/or Pentagon involved https://t.co/Jdb3H22LHn"},{"author_id":"27620289","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:56:17.000Z",